<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63157" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐθόβολ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		(parox.) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throwing stones,
				pelting with stones</i>: -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόλοι, οἱ</span>, <i>stone-throwers</i>,
			distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφενδονῆται</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.69
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				3.7.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνῆτες λ. καὶ ἀκοντισταί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Criti.</u>
					119b
				</span></i>
			: sg., as winner of a contest, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1061.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i> (Samos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόλος, ὁ</span>, <i>engine for hurling
				stones</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				8.5.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Moschio
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.208c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
			</span></i> Mech.<i><span class="en">
				18.6
			</span></i>; distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπέλτης</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.48
			</span></i>; also -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόλον, τό</span>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ma.</u>
				6.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				5.6.3
			</span></i>; in full, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. μηχαναί</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.9.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> proparox.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιθόβολος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, 
				Pass.
			, <i>struck with stones, stoned</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1063
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
